title: "scRNA-seq-reproducible: a config-driven single-cell RNA-seq pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, deterministic Scanpy/scverse pipeline that runs QC, normalisation, clustering and marker-gene detection on any public single-cell RNA-seq dataset.
